186
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:37,020
But look at the formal versions, continue, postpone, investigate, it's an instant

187
00:09:37,020 --> 00:09:40,500
an upgrade that makes you sound so much more articulate.

188
00:09:40,500 --> 00:09:42,540
Let's look at a classic example.

189
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:45,300
Showed up, sounds like something your friend does at a party,

190
00:09:45,300 --> 00:09:49,420
