192
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,500
See the difference?

193
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:54,430
So simple, but so powerful.

194
00:09:54,430 --> 00:09:57,190
Said now, it's super direct, right?

195
00:09:57,190 --> 00:10:00,270
Maybe a little too direct for an email to your boss.

196
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:02,390
That's why we have the word declined.

197
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:05,070
It's just smoother, more polite.

198
00:10:05,070 --> 00:10:06,710
It gets the same message across,

199
00:10:06,710 --> 00:10:08,870
