202
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:15,870
The formal single word version, simple, contact.

203
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:19,330
And hey, for extra points, swap out soon for shortly.

204
00:10:19,330 --> 00:10:23,120
It just adds that final little touch of professional polish.

205
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:25,940
Okay, this is where it all comes together,

